 "title": "Democratic Knowledge Database",
 "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/14018668",
 "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14018668",
 "description": "<p>The Democratic Knowledge Database was developed within the EU-funded project <em>Network of Networks 4 Democracy</em>, as part of WP3, <em>Connecting Scattered Knowledge on Democratic Innovations</em>. It aims to systematize and classify extensive knowledge generated by academia and civil society on inclusive democratic innovations. The current version includes metadata and content data for 346 policy and academic documents on democratic innovation. An accompanying report details the database&rsquo;s goals, selection process, coding procedures, and variable descriptions.</p>",
